      <title>Splashy Spring Waterfalls</title>
      <link>https://www.eugenecascadescoast.org/blog/post/spring-waterfalls/</link>
      <description>Snowmelt and springtime showers swell rivers and reservoirs, making this the best season for dramatic waterfall viewing. The big, spectacular waterfalls are even bigger, while smaller "springtime-only" waterfalls can be spotted roadside or along damp hiking trails. Just remember to wear boots that can get muddy!</description>
